'''Type of feat''': [[Class]]

'''Prerequisite''': [[Duelist]] level 7

'''Specifics''':  The duelist may choose two methods of dexterous fighting: 
*1) Parry Mode: The [[character]] gains a bonus to her [[parry]] skill equal to her duelist level. 
*2) Defensive Fighting Mode: The character gains a bonus to their [[armor class]] equal to their [[class level]] plus 2 (maximum +12.) <br />At the same time, the character suffers a -4 attack penalty to [[attack roll]]s while this mode is active. 

'''Use''':  Selected

==Notes==
*Added in the [[PRC Expansion Pack]].

